{
  "_comment": [
    "The sixteen bosses. Same schema as enemies.json plus two fields:",
    "  phases          - health fractions where the fight changes, high to low",
    "  phaseAggression - one multiplier per phase, applied to speed and to how",
    "                    often the boss commits. Phase 0 is the opening.",
    "",
    "A boss is not a special kind of object - it is an enemy whose numbers are",
    "frightening and whose arena locks behind it. Every one keeps a recoverTime",
    "long enough to punish, because a boss with no punish window is not hard,",
    "it is just a wall.",
    "",
    "Boss drops are all chance 1.0: a boss is fought once, so a roll that can",
    "fail would mean an upgrade path that is out of reach through no fault of",
    "the player. The reinforcement materials are gated here, and only the last",
    "boss carries the heart that takes a weapon to +10."
  ],

